      {
        "script_id": "ezetimibe",
        "how_to_tell_apart": "Statins block cholesterol synthesis in the liver and lower LDL by 30 to 50% or more; ezetimibe blocks cholesterol absorption in the gut and lowers LDL by about 20%."
